  "caption": "Cantonese stomp-chant dance-pop, mid-2020s Hong Kong pop with hip-hop stomp rhythms. Heavy floor-tom stomps and layered handclaps driving the groove; a popping slap bass line; bright clavinet stabs on the offbeats; short punchy brass hits at chorus ends. Dry punchy drums up front, clean modern mix, wide gang vocals. Male tenor with bouncy half-spoken verses and a shouted crowd-chant chorus. 118 BPM, A minor. Cheeky, flustered and laughing at himself. No autotune, no trap hi-hat rolls, no EDM drop, no ballad breakdown, no rock guitars.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - stomps and claps, slap bass enters]\n\n[Verse 1]\n姑娘叫我躺低啲\n燈一開就照住我面\n佢話洗牙好快搞掂\n我抓實張櫈個邊\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n佢一路刮一路問我\n最近做緊乜嘢呀\n\n[Chorus]\n張大口 啊 啊\n我答你都係得把聲\n張大口 啊 啊\n你問嘢我點樣應\n\n[Verse 2]\n佢問我放假去咗邊\n我話呃呃佢就點頭\n佢話嘩北海道好正\n其實我講緊屯門\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n佢再問我有冇女朋友\n吸口水管響得好大聲\n\n[Chorus]\n張大口 啊 啊\n有冇都係呢把聲\n張大口 啊 啊\n你估啱咗我都唔認\n\n[Verse 3]\n漱口嗰陣我想解釋\n佢已經叫下一位\n牙縫仲有少少血\n我笑到成口都痺\n\n[Bridge - claps and bass only]\n半年之後再嚟一次\n今次輪到我問佢先\n\n[Chorus]\n張大口 啊 啊\n姑娘你又去咗邊\n張大口 啊 啊\n原來佢都係呃呃咁應\n\n[Outro - stomps fade, brass hit]\n張大口 啊\n下次見",
